#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:6
msgid "This raises the cost of abuse. It does not prove who anyone is."
msgstr "這只能提高濫用的成本，不能證明對方是誰。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:7
msgid ""
"The AES key is shared with the browser so the page can encrypt its "
"payload, which means anyone who opens devtools can read it and sign their"
" own. Use it as friction against scripted clients; decide identity with "
"the session."
msgstr ""
"AES "
"密鑰要交給瀏覽器，頁面才能加密載荷；這意味著任何人打開開發人員工具都能讀到它，並自己產生載荷。把它當作給腳本用戶端增加的阻力，身份仍由會話決定。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:15
msgid "This browser"
msgstr "本瀏覽器"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:16
msgid ""
"The visitor id is derived from device characteristics and kept in memory "
"only. The encrypted payload is reused until it expires, then rebuilt."
msgstr "訪客 id 由裝置特徵推算，只保存在記憶體裡。加密後的載荷在過期前重複使用，過期後重新產生。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:22
msgid "Visitor id"
msgstr "訪客 id"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:23
msgid "Not generated yet"
msgstr "尚未產生"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:26
msgid "Payload accepted within"
msgstr "載荷有效期"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:27
#, python-format
msgid "%(seconds)s seconds of its timestamp"
msgstr "時間戳前後 %(seconds)s 秒內"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:30
msgid "Limit for this probe"
msgstr "本探針的限額"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:31
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s requests per %(window)s seconds"
msgstr "每 %(window)s 秒 %(count)s 次請求"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:41
msgid "A real payload passes"
msgstr "真實載荷可以通過"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:42
msgid "Proves the browser and the server agree on the key and the wire format."
msgstr "證明瀏覽器和伺服器端的密鑰與傳輸格式一致。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:46
msgid "Send with fingerprint"
msgstr "帶指紋傳送"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:56
msgid "No header is refused"
msgstr "不帶請求標頭會被拒絕"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:57
msgid ""
"A scripted client that skips the page's crypto gets 403, and the attempt "
"is recorded against its IP."
msgstr "跳過頁面加密的腳本用戶端會得到 403，這次嘗試會記在它的 IP 上。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:61
msgid "Send without fingerprint"
msgstr "不帶指紋傳送"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:71
msgid "An edited payload is refused"
msgstr "被改過的載荷會被拒絕"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:72
msgid ""
"One byte is flipped before sending. AES-GCM authenticates, so the server "
"rejects it rather than decrypting something else."
msgstr "傳送前改掉一個位元組。AES-GCM 帶認證，所以伺服器端直接拒絕，而不是解出別的內容。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:76
msgid "Send an edited payload"
msgstr "傳送改過的載荷"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:86
msgid "Too many requests are refused"
msgstr "請求過多會被拒絕"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:87
msgid ""
"The same visitor id keeps arriving, so the combined fingerprint/IP "
"limiter stops it and says when to come back."
msgstr "同一個訪客 id 不斷到來，指紋與 IP 聯合限流器會攔下它，並告知何時可以再試。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:91
msgid "Send until refused"
msgstr "一直傳送直到被拒"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:101
msgid "Making it harder to defeat"
msgstr "讓它更難被繞過"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:103
msgid ""
"Everything below raises the cost further. None of it turns this into "
"authentication."
msgstr "下面每一項都能進一步提高成本，但沒有一項能讓它變成身份認證。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:106
msgid "Derive the visitor id from more signals."
msgstr "用更多訊號推算訪客 id。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:107
msgid ""
"This page uses a small built-in hash of navigator and screen properties "
"so the framework needs no extra dependency. A library such as "
"FingerprintJS reads many more signals and survives more browser changes; "
"pass it to createFingerprintSender as the visitorId provider."
msgstr ""
"本頁用一個內建的小雜湊，根據 navigator 和 screen 的屬性計算，框架因此不需要額外相依套件。FingerprintJS "
"這類函式庫讀取的訊號多得多，瀏覽器有變化時也更穩定；把它作為 visitorId 提供者傳給 createFingerprintSender "
"即可。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:110
msgid "Obfuscate the key in your bundle."
msgstr "在建置產物裡混淆密鑰。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:111
msgid ""
"The key reaches the browser at build time, never from the page. Splitting"
" it across arrays combined at runtime, and running a JavaScript "
"obfuscator over the build, both mean a static search of the bundle no "
"longer finds it."
msgstr ""
"密鑰在建置時進入瀏覽器程式碼，從不來自頁面。把它拆進幾個執行時再拼接的陣列，或對建置產物執行 JavaScript "
"混淆器，都能讓對建置產物的靜態搜尋找不到它。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:114
msgid "Rotate the key."
msgstr "定期更換密鑰。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:115
msgid ""
"Deploy the frontend and the setting together. A key that has leaked stays"
" useful until it changes."
msgstr "前端和設定要一起部署。洩漏的密鑰在更換之前一直可用。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:118
msgid "Keep the accepted window narrow."
msgstr "把有效時間窗口設窄。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:119
msgid ""
"timestamp_max_diff bounds how long a captured payload can be replayed. "
"Shorten it until clock skew between your users and your servers starts to"
" hurt."
msgstr "timestamp_max_diff 限定截獲的載荷能被重放多久。可以一直縮短，直到使用者與伺服器之間的時鐘偏差開始造成問題。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:122
msgid "Give each sensitive route its own bucket."
msgstr "給每個敏感路由單獨的額度。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:123
msgid ""
"rate_limits is keyed by endpoint, so a login route can be far stricter "
"than a catalog page without slowing browsing down."
msgstr "rate_limits 按介面分別設定，所以登入介面可以比目錄頁嚴格得多，而不會拖慢一般瀏覽。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:126
msgid "Watch the anomalies."
msgstr "關注異常。"

#: templates/pages/examples/security/fingerprint.html:127
msgid ""
"The limiter also reports one fingerprint arriving from many IPs, and one "
"IP carrying many fingerprints. Those patterns identify automation that a "
"per-request check cannot."
msgstr "限流器還會報告同一個指紋來自很多 IP、同一個 IP 帶著很多指紋的情況。這些模式能識別出逐個請求檢查發現不了的自動化行為。"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/expiry.html:5
msgid "Observe expired-Session UI"
msgstr "觀察過期會話 UI"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/expiry.html:7
#, python-format
