"Redis normally removes the record after %(seconds)s seconds. This "
"demonstration removes only the current record now; the browser then "
"follows the same SSE invalidation path as natural expiry."
msgstr "Redis 通常會在 %(seconds)s 秒後刪除記錄。此演示現在僅刪除當前記錄；然後，瀏覽器遵循與自然過期相同的 SSE 失效路徑。"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/expiry.html:8
