"The signed cookie contains only the Session ID. Strongly typed identity "
"data lives in Redis and works across Sanic workers."
msgstr "簽名 Cookie 中只儲存會話 ID；強型別身份資料儲存在 Redis 中，可跨 Sanic worker 使用。"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/lifecycle.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "Configured lifetime: %(seconds)s seconds"
msgstr "配置的生命週期：%(seconds)s 秒"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/lifecycle.html:21
