msgstr "原始會話 ID 故意不呈現到頁面中。"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/revoke.html:5
msgid "Revoke current-user Sessions"
msgstr "撤銷當前使用者會話"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/revoke.html:7
msgid ""
"This uses Session.force_logout_user for the signed-in user. The shared "
"user EventSource detects the removed Redis record, shows the Session-"
"expired alert and returns the browser to login."
msgstr ""
"這裡會對已登入使用者呼叫 Session.force_logout_user。共享使用者 EventSource 檢測到 Redis "
"記錄被移除後，會顯示會話過期提醒並將瀏覽器返回登入頁。"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/revoke.html:8
msgid "Revoke all current-user Sessions?"
msgstr "撤銷所有當前使用者會話？"

#: templates/pages/examples/session/revoke.html:10
msgid "Revoke my Sessions"
msgstr "撤銷我的會話"

#: templates/pages/examples/sortable/workflow.html:5
